OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds still without power after
OL,4,AStorm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of households across Cumbria
OL,7,Fand parts of north-eastern England
OL,8,Fremain without power in the wake of
OL,9,FStorm Boelo.
OL,11,FElectricity North West said it was
OL,12,Fworking to restore power supplies to
OL,13,Fhundreds of homes, with the worst
OL,14,Faffected parts of Cumbria including
OL,15,FAllerdale, Copeland and South Lakeland.
OL,17,FMeanwhile Northern Powergrid said
OL,18,Fhundreds of customers were cut off in
OL,19,FNorthumberland and County Durham.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
