OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds still without power after
OL,4,AStorm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Rail said trains between
OL,7,FAshington and Newcastle would not call
OL,8,Fat Northumberland Park, while services
OL,9,Ffrom Newcastle to Ashington will not
OL,10,Fstop at Blyth Bebside. Disruption is
OL,11,Falso expected on the line between
OL,12,FWindermere and Oxenholme.
